| `tests.ship_set` | list of strings | every test module that renders a project in keel; `[]` in a generated project; absent, `[]`, which the loader reports as `[using default] tests.ship_set = []` | repository-relative `test_*.py` module paths without whitespace, globs or node ids | `scripts/config_get.py` through the loader, called by `make test-ship`; `tests/integration/test_copier_ship_set.py` | Selects exactly the modules that render a project, directly or through helpers or fixtures under `tests/`, before full verify in every round. The derivation test fails missing, stale or duplicate entries and zero renderers. | the full suite: `make test`; an empty set refuses `test-ship` | always |
